    "question": "<figure class=\"madas-excerpt\"><img src=\"resources/madas/alevel-pure-w/q10-question-1.svg\" alt=\"Liquid is kept in containers, which due to evaporation and ongoing chemical reactions, at the end of each month the volume of the liquid in these containers reduces by 4% compared with the volume at the start of the same month. At the start of each month a new container is filled up with 200 litres of liquid, so that at the end of thirty months there are 30 containers with liquid. Calculate the total amount of liquid in the 30 containers at the end of 30 months. ( ) 7\" style=\"--madas-width:589.3px\"></figure>",
